~ pry_door
do freezePlayer()
if SaveLoad.SaveFileData.inventoryContents.has("Jimmy") == true:
	do playSound("res://resources/sfx/WoodSnap5.ogg")
#	do unlockClosetDoor()
#	do destory(find_closest(actionables), actionables)
	You: The door is now open.
else
	You: You pull on the door as hard as you can. It's jammed.
do unfreezePlayer()
=> END

~ escape
do freezePlayer()
do playAnimation("Wasteland" ,cutscene_player, false)
do wait(2)
Queen: Congragulations, [wait=0.2]as I did many years ago you are leaving my birthplace.
Queen: You've proven youself.
Queen: Look out at my work.
do playAnimation("Wasteland_2" ,cutscene_player, false)
do wait(1)
Queen: One day nature will overtake it [wait=0.1]as I have planned.
Queen: When you are ready,[wait=0.1] to the North there is a sewers.
Queen: Its been dried after disuse, when you are found I will not be your guide any longer.
Queen: Your eyes have adjusted nicely, let us start.
do wait(2)
do unfreezePlayer()
do transitionRoom("LabExterior", "LEMD")
=> END

~ exp1_intro
do freezePlayer()
do playAnimation("QueenEnter", cutscene_animation_player, false)
do wait(0.10)
do destory(cutscene_light, null)
do changePlayerTexture("PlayerRol")
do changePlayerTexture("PlayerFlat")
do wait(3)
Queen: ...i had [wait=0.3]not anticipated the shared experence of pain.[wait=1.0] ahem.
do wait(0.5)
Queen: Dont whine to me.[wait=0.3] Stand up! [wait=0.1]Dont act so worthless...
do wait(1)
do playAnimation("QueenExit", cutscene_animation_player, false)
do wait(0.4)
do changePlayerTexture("PlayerStand")
do wait(0.4)
do changePlayerTexture("fem_walk_down")
do destory(cutscenes, null)
do unfreezePlayer()
=> END

~ got_you_now
do player.global_position = Vector2(1063,-2545)
=> END

~ locker_1
do freezePlayer()
You: You tug on the handle but its locked
- Press Random Buttons
	You: After bashing the keypad, the prompt changes to asking for the number of kids you have to reset the password.
	You: Its best to come back when you have that infomation.
- Leave
do unfreezePlayer()
=> END

~ jimmy_locker
do freezePlayer()
You: Opening the door the light catches on a rusted Jimmy.
You: You slip the Jimmy onto your back for later.
You: A Jimmy added to your inventory.
do giveItem("Jimmy")
do unfreezePlayer()
=> END

~ flesh_barrier
do freezePlayer()
You: The stairway seems to be blocked by a wall of flesh from wall to wall,[wait=0.3] it feels dry agasint your fingers.
- Spill Orange Mixture [if inventory.has("FleshBurningMixture") == true]
	do destory(fleshWall, null)
	do destory(meatwall_1, null)
	do destory(meatwall_2, null)
	do destory(fleshwall_actionable, actionables)
	do SaveLoad.SaveFileData.burned_away_flesh = true
	You: As the mixture ignites the flesh burns away instintaniously,[wait=0.3] the path up opened.
- Spill Mixture [if inventory.has("Mixture") == true]
	% You: You spill it to no effect
	% You: It bubbles softly on the flesh with no effect
	do unfreezePlayer()
	=> END
- Back
	do unfreezePlayer()
	=> END
do unfreezePlayer()
=> END

~ open_mixer
do freezePlayer()
do toggleVisiblity(mixingUI)
=> END

~ documentation
do freezePlayer()
You: The drawer opens smoothly, each filled to the brim with documents
- Look Inside
	You: Endless papers can be found, you'd need a name to find any real information.
- Search for 1008 [if SaveLoad.SaveFileData.hasGaurd1Seen]
- Search for 1000 [if SaveLoad.SaveFileData.hasGaurd1Seen]
- Leave
do unfreezePlayer()
=> END

~ lifted_lockdown
do freezePlayer()
do changeCameraTarget(camera_marker_2)
do SaveLoad.SaveFileData.LockdownTriggered = true
do changeDoorLock(front_hall_do_entrance_hall_first_dooror_2, false)
do playSound("res://resources/sfx/cutscenes/announcement.mp3")
do wait(1)
EAS: LOCKDOWN HAS BEEN LIFTED, MAKE YOUR WAY TO THE ENTRACE PROMPTLY.
do wait(1)
do changeCameraTarget(player)
do unfreezePlayer()
=> END

~ insert_key_1
do freezePlayer()
You: Theres a key hole on this panel.
~ key_1_choice
- Insert and Twist Red Key [if inventory.has("GaurdKey2")]
	You: It slips in with a nice click, twisting and giving a confirming click.
	do SaveLoad.SaveFileData.Key1In = true
	do removeItem("GaurdKey1")
	=> key_1_choice
- Insert and Twist Purple Key [if inventory.has("GaurdKey1")]
	You: The only way to make this key fit would be to crush it into the hole.
- Leave
if SaveLoad.SaveFileData.Key2In == true and SaveLoad.SaveFileData.Key1In == true:
	do startCutscene("res://resources/dialogue/Lab/LiftLockdown.dialogue")
do unfreezePlayer()
=> END

~ insert_key_2
do freezePlayer()
You: Theres a key hole on this panel.
~ key_2_choice
- Insert and Twist Red Key [if inventory.has("GaurdKey1")]
	You: It slips in with a nice click, twisting and giving a confirming click.
	do SaveLoad.SaveFileData.Key2In = true
	do removeItem("GaurdKey2")
- Insert and Twist Purple Key [if inventory.has("GaurdKey2")]
	You: The only way to make this key fit would be to crush it into the hole.
	=> key_2_choice
- Leave
if SaveLoad.SaveFileData.Key2In == true and SaveLoad.SaveFileData.Key1In == true:
	do startCutscene("res://resources/dialogue/Lab/LiftLockdown.dialogue")
do unfreezePlayer()
=> END

~ start_lockdown
do playSound("res://resources/sfx/Common/indoor door lock 3.wav")
do changeDoorLock(entrance_hall_second_door, true)
do wait(0.5)
do playSound("res://resources/sfx/cutscenes/EASALARM.wav")
do wait(3)
do playSound("res://resources/sfx/cutscenes/EASALARM.wav")
do wait(3)
do playSound("res://resources/sfx/cutscenes/EASALARM.wav")
do wait(3)
do playSound("res://resources/sfx/cutscenes/EASALARM.wav")
do wait(3)
do playSound("res://resources/sfx/cutscenes/EASALARM.wav")
do wait(3)
do freezePlayer()
EAS: UNREGESTERED LIFE FORM IN ENTRANCE HALL, [wait=0.2]PLEASE AWAIT INSTRUCTIONS
do wait(2)
Queen: Well...  [#mood=nervous]
Queen: These sensors were not functional when I was here last.[#mood=nervous]
Queen: Steel doors have closed around all exits.
Queen: They are uniquely tiring to tear down.
Queen: ..however,[wait=0.2] I see a way for you to lift the lock down yourself.
Queen: Let me clear the way for you,[wait=0.2]watch closely.
do changeCameraTarget(camera_marker)
do wait(1)
do playAnimation("grow", cutscene_player, false)
do wait(1)
do playAnimation("emerge", cutscene_player, false)
do wait(1)
do playAnimation("REMOVEOBSTACLE", cutscene_player, false)
do wait(2)
do destory(entrance_hall_second_door, null)
do wait(3)
do playAnimation("retreat", cutscene_player, false)
do wait(1.71)
do changeCameraTarget(player)
do unfreezePlayer()
do wait(1)
do destory(camera_marker, null)
do destory(tenticle, null)
=> END